--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on the data

The released ratings contain no personal identifiers. Physicians appear only as
anonymized rater and person identifiers (R1-R12, P01-P09); no names are
released. Scenario text is adapted from publicly posted patient forum content
with identifying detail removed, and source URLs are withheld to protect the
privacy of the original posters.
